OL,3,AUkraine doesn't deserve 'respite',
OL,4,ARussia's Lavrov says, as Zelensky says
OL,5,Ahe'd support Trump's energy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky says
OL,8,FRussia hit a power plant in Ukraine
OL,9,F"immediately after" Donald Trump
OL,10,Fannounced what he called an energy
OL,11,Fceasefire
OL,13,FBut Zelensky says Ukraine is willing to
OL,14,Fback an energy truce if Moscow does the
OL,15,Fsame, adding it could "become a major
OL,16,Fstep toward ending the war"
OL,18,FAsked about the energy truce, a Kremlin
OL,19,Fspokesman says: "As soon as we have
OL,20,Fsomething to say on the matter, we will
OL,21,Finform you"
